    "full_content": "<article class=\"\"><div class=\"page-wrapper PostDetail-module-scss-module__UQuRMa__hero\"><div class=\"PostDetail-module-scss-module__UQuRMa__illustrationHeroWrapper\"><div class=\"Illustration-module-scss-module__WyGOtq__root Illustration-module-scss-module__WyGOtq__aspect-wide Illustration-module-scss-module__WyGOtq__padding-lg Illustration-module-scss-module__WyGOtq__radius-lg bg-heather\"><div class=\"Illustration-module-scss-module__WyGOtq__inner\"><img alt=\"Building on our commitment to American scientific discovery\" class=\"\" height=\"1000\" src=\"https://www-cdn.anthropic.com/images/4zrzovbb/website/d6058e0db8e477dc782dacae46e2ec6663d165d9-1000x1000.svg\" width=\"1000\" /></div></div></div></div><div class=\"page-wrapper\"><article><div class=\"\"><div class=\"Body-module-scss-module__z40yvW__body\"><p class=\"Body-module-scss-module__z40yvW__reading-column body-2 serif post-text\">Anthropic is deepening its support for American scientific research by committing $150 million over three years to the <a href=\"https://www.energy.gov/undersecretaryforscience/genesis-mission/genesis-mission\">Genesis Mission</a>, a federal initiative to accelerate scientific and technological discovery through AI. The funding will go toward making Claude available to more than 15 agencies that are part of the mission, including NASA, the National Institutes of Health, and the National Science Foundation.</p><p class=\"Body-module-scss-module__z40yvW__reading-column body-2 serif post-text\">We first announced our partnership with the US Department of Energy (DOE) and the Genesis Mission <a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/news/genesis-mission-partnership\">last December</a>. Since then, we have…",
